:: Event - Desperate parent [Place]
<h1 class="ptitle"><<=$game.cabinName ?? ''>></h1>
<br />

<center>
	<<image 'places/cabin/desperate_parent.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

A man was waiting at the gate when you came out, a young woman standing quiet beside him. He didn't look like trouble. He looked like someone who'd run out of every other option.

<br /><br />

<<newguy>>
<<set _dpFather = $tmpGuy>>
<<sayNpc _dpFather>>
	She's sick. Getting worse every day. I heard you've got antibiotics. I don't have caps, I don't have food to trade. I have her. She's strong, she'll work hard. Please.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />

<<newgirl>>
<<set $tmpGirl.sick = { days: 2, desc: 'Fever', id: 'wasteland_fever' }>>
<<set _dpGirl = clone($tmpGirl)>>
<<unset $tmpGirl>>

<<= _dpGirl.name >> kept her eyes on the ground, too tired or too ashamed to look up.

<br /><br />

<div id="dp_choices">

<<if setup.cabinInventory.count('antibiotics') >= 2>>
<div id="dp_slave">
	<<linkreplace 'Take her as a slave — give 2 antibiotics'>>
		<<run $('#dp_guest, #dp_aid, #dp_refuse').hide()>>
		<<run setup.cabinInventory.drop('antibiotics', 2)>>
		<<addmins 60>>
		<<set _dpGirl.sub = Math.min((_dpGirl.sub ?? 0) + 20, 100)>>
		<<run $slaves.push(_dpGirl)>>
		The father pressed the medicine into her hands one last time before you took her, then turned and walked away without looking back.
		<br /><br />
		She stood in your yard, feverish and unsure of what came next.
		<br /><br />
		<<sayNpc _dpGirl>>
			Tell me what you need me to do.
		<</sayNpc>>
		<br />
		<<link 'Continue'>><<goto 'Wood cabin'>><</link>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>

<div id="dp_guest">
	<<linkreplace 'Take her in as a free person — give 2 antibiotics'>>
		<<run $('#dp_slave, #dp_aid, #dp_refuse').hide()>>
		<<run setup.cabinInventory.drop('antibiotics', 2)>>
		<<addmins 45>>
		<<run $guests.push(_dpGirl)>>
		You handed over the medicine and told her she was a guest, not property. Her father's shoulders dropped with relief he didn't bother hiding.
		<br /><br />
		<<sayNpc _dpGirl>>
			I can work. I'll earn my place.
		<</sayNpc>>
		<br />
		<<link 'Continue'>><<goto 'Wood cabin'>><</link>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>

<div id="dp_aid">
	<<linkreplace 'Give the antibiotics, take no one'>>
		<<run $('#dp_slave, #dp_guest, #dp_refuse').hide()>>
		<<run setup.cabinInventory.drop('antibiotics', 2)>>
		<<addmins 20>>
		You pressed the bottles into his hands and told him to take her home. He stared at you like he was waiting for the catch.
		<br /><br />
		<<sayNpc _dpFather>>
			I don't understand. Why—
		<</sayNpc>>
		<br />
		<<you>>
			Just go home. Take care of her.
		<</you>>
		<br />
		<<set $player.goodwill += 3>>
		<<link 'Continue'>><<goto 'Wood cabin'>><</link>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<</if>>

<div id="dp_refuse">
	<<linkreplace 'Turn them away'>>
		<<run $('#dp_slave, #dp_guest, #dp_aid').hide()>>
		<<set $player.goodwill -= 3>>
		You told him you couldn't spare it. He didn't argue. He just picked up his daughter's hand and led her back out into the wastes.
		<br /><br />
		<<link 'Continue'>><<goto 'Wood cabin'>><</link>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>

</div>
